WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.350
Have you ever wondered what SCP-516,&nbsp;
the Intelligent Tank, wants?

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:10.350
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire&nbsp;
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-516&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.610
while it was sitting in its garage after&nbsp;
having been washed. This was the result:

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:18.930
"Sitting under trees in a meadow,&nbsp;
with birds perched on its main gun,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.510
and flowers growing all over its chassis."

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:27.990
Like so many of us, it seems all SCP-516&nbsp;
wants is some peace and fresh air.

